v 3
d regfast: fast HDFE OLS/IV, PPML and logit (Rust plugin)
d
d regfast (OLS and IV/2SLS), ppmlfast (Poisson pseudo-maximum likelihood) and logitfast (logit)
d estimate models with any number of absorbed high-dimensional fixed effects, heterogeneous
d slopes, weights and multiway clustering. Syntax, estimates and stored results follow reghdfe,
d ivreghdfe and ppmlhdfe. The estimation core is a compiled Rust plugin (Linux, macOS, Windows).
d
d Author: Leo Liu, auleo.liu@gmail.com
d License: MIT
d Distribution-Date: 20261011
